{"indicator":"rate","unit":"每 10 萬人","years":[2000,2001,2002,2003,2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023],"notes":{"TWN":"台灣不在 WHO 的資料裡，這裡用交通部統計查詢網的道路交通事故 30 日內死亡人數（事故後 30 天內死亡，2008 年起，跟 WHO 的定義相同）÷ 聯合國 WPP 的年中人口。警察機關的 A1 類事故只算當場或 24 小時內死亡，早年常被引用的死亡人數是 24 小時的定義，比 30 日的少很多，不能跟其他國家比。2024、2025 年的 30 日內死亡人數是 2,950、2,858 人（每 10 萬人 12.7、12.4），WHO 的資料只到 2023 年，所以地圖只到 2023 年。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"Taiwan is not in the WHO data. Its figures are road traffic deaths within 30 days of the crash from the Ministry of Transportation and Communications (since 2008, the same definition as WHO) divided by the UN WPP mid-year population. Police A1 crash statistics count only deaths at the scene or within 24 hours; the 24-hour totals often quoted in the past are much lower than the 30-day ones and are not comparable with other countries. Deaths within 30 days were 2,950 in 2024 and 2,858 in 2025 (12.7 and 12.4 per 100,000); WHO data end in 2023, so the map does too."},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[-1,193,1,0,-2,-2,0,-1,-1,-3,-3,-3,0,-2,-4,-6,-4,-2,-3,-3,-1,-12,7,1,2]},"values":{"AGO":[-1,223,-2,-5,4,-2,-7,-3,-3,-1,6,-5,-19,22,-13,-9,-6,0,-5,-5,-1,-26,7,-6,-5],"ARM":[-1,112,4,-9,7,79,0,-79,30,24,-2,-7,14,4,-4,4,58,-61,0,2,-39,-10,9,0,-3],"ARG":[-1,114,3,-18,-4,12,10,14,10,7,-14,-5,10,-8,12,-10,-13,12,0,-4,-15,-33,22,5,-4],"AZE":[-1,273,5,2,0,7,-17,-12,-10,-2,-2,-1,-4,-8,-13,-4,1,-5,-1,-5,-3,-32,3,-14,-10],"BEN":[-1,203,3,1,-2,-1,5,-5,-6,-1,1,-37,4,13,1,3,5,5,3,-3,-1,13,44,6,23],"BGR":[-1,133,8,-11,-4,3,-2,20,4,0,-25,-19,-16,-7,-1,9,8,1,-3,-9,2,-23,16,-4,-1],"BIH":[-1,214,-4,-4,-4,-4,-8,-5,-6,-6,-1,-2,-21,-1,-1,1,0,-2,-5,-5,-6,-5,12,-12,-3],"BEL":[-1,166,-8,-20,-17,-6,-6,-4,3,-14,0,-13,1,-10,-1,-2,1,-9,-5,-2,4,-14,1,2,-3],"AUS":[-1,99,-5,-2,-7,-2,1,-3,-1,-8,0,-6,-6,-1,-5,0,-1,2,-4,-4,4,-7,1,2,2],"ARE":[-1,295,10,-7,31,-32,-17,-21,2,-38,-46,-34,-19,-17,2,9,-8,7,-30,-12,-4,-17,4,-4,-3],"BGD":[-1,115,18,17,15,13,12,-1,-10,